<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.720.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.720.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance said thatits auction on Wednesday of 1.4 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills produced the following results:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.720  Stop rate     0.556 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.723  Average yield 0.549 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   5.7882  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.3997  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 11.4736 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 Aug 11, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity	   Feb 10, 1998</p>
